==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*12 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 25.33 seconds<sup>760f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

